{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47093","headline":"与王嵩隐 · 尚颜","name":"与王嵩隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一生吟兴僻，方见业精微。\n事若终难得，乡应不易归。\n乱收西日叶，双掩北风扉。\n合国诸卿相，皆曾着布衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尚颜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47093.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47093","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}